1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Hey, welcome to the workshop.
Today we're building something together.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
This is a subtitle translation tool.
Left side shows the original text.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,000
The right side is where your translation goes.
Each line lines up, row by row.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,000
Click any line on either side.
Both sides highlight the matching row.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,000
When you're done, export the translated SRT.
Or keep both languages side by side.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,000
You can also call an AI translator with one click.
Just paste your API key above.

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Let's make subtitle translation painless.
Enjoy the demo.
